{"id":"662792","name":"番茄冬瓜","author":"seiseizhang","authorId":"2304656","desc":"","cover":"images/662792/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"2个"},{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"1/2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜丝","amount":"少量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"番茄去蒂、改刀切小块。冬瓜去皮，切厚块。生姜切丝。","img":"images/662792/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"热油爆香生姜丝。","img":"images/662792/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"接着放入番茄，加入白糖和少量清水，翻炒。","img":"images/662792/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"待番茄变软并出沙后，放入冬瓜。","img":"images/662792/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入精盐，翻炒均匀，盖上锅盖，中小火焖煮。","img":"images/662792/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"待冬瓜变软后，倒入少量番茄酱调味。","img":"images/662792/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"熟透入味后出锅。","img":"images/662792/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}